==== CREATE OBJECT ====

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Administrator
    participant UI as UI
    participant IS as InventoryService
    participant OTS as ObjectTypeService
    participant DB as Database

    A->>UI: Open "Create Object"

    UI->>OTS: getObjectTypes()
    OTS->>DB: findAllObjectTypes()
    DB-->>OTS: objectTypeList
    OTS-->>UI: objectTypeList

    A->>UI: Insert object data
    

    UI->>IS: createObject(objectData)

    IS->>OTS: checkObjectTypeExists(typeCode)
    OTS->>DB: findObjectType(typeCode)
    DB-->>OTS: objectType / null

    alt Object type exists
        OTS-->>IS: valid type
        IS->>DB: insertObject(objectData)
        DB-->>IS: objectId
        IS-->>UI: objectCreated(objectId)
        UI-->>A: Object successfully created
    else Object type not exists
        OTS-->>IS: type not found
        IS-->>UI: requestCreateObjectType
        UI-->>A: Object type not present
    end

